      "en" : "Controlled vocabulary of the extinguisher classes applicable to a battery, used as the value set of batlab:extinguishingAgent. Replaces the free-text values of the battery-labeling module. The five classes A, B, C, D and F are those of EN 2:2005, the standard to which BatteryPass-Ready long list attribute 24 pins the determination of the fire class."
